<codeline><highlight class="normal">here<sp/>are<sp/>some<sp/>instructions,<sp/>depending<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>target<sp/>you<sp/>wish<sp/>to<sp/>use<sp/><sp/>generate</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">######<sp/>For<sp/>MS-DOS<sp/></highlight></codeline>
